<title>INDIA: India's Siemens down ahead of results.</title>
<headline>India's Siemens down ahead of results.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of electrical equipment maker Siemens India Ltd fell 10.50 rupees, or 4.5 percent, to 224.50 in early trade on the Bombay bourse on Wednesday ahead of the firm's financial results, traders said.  </p>
<p>Siemens is due to announce its results for year ended March 31, 1997 on Friday and analysts are expecting the company to report a loss for that year.</p>
<p>The firm had reported a net loss of 239 million rupees in the first six months of 1996/97 due to &quot;considerable losses&quot; from its telecommunications division.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
